<p>But they are still just illusions.<br />
Set it off to one side in a non-critical archival wing and post a sign to ignore the harmless phantasms. I'd think that ghosts that don't drive you crazy or poltergeist you into walls would be a refreshing break compared to what most Foundation staff are used to.<br />
