			<div class="content" id="post-content-2107157">
									

<p>I agree. On my first read I assumed that everyone was affected in its &quot;sphere&quot; of influence, i.e. wherever the illusions show up. This would be quite troublesome to have everyone in a 100m radius constantly worried something bad is going to happen. Having hundreds of red, 4 eyed ghost things pilling up would be quite disruptive to work and the state of mind of the scientists and their visibility, as well as other SCPs on the site that might be aware of their presence. Also, why not have all the things in the same room? Will it not work?</p>
<p>Maybe it needs some small rewriting to make its containment procedures more valid, or the other way around.</p>
<p>EDIT: Whops, sorry for the late date, I need to make more of a habit of checking when things are posted.</p>

